## Prioritized Remediation Plan

| Priority | Smell | Test Method | Effort |
|----------|-------|-------------|--------|
| 1 | Assertion-Free | `addAndDoNothing` | Trivial — add one `assertEquals` |
| 2 | Exception Handling | `addNullSkuManualCatch` | Low — replace try/catch with `assertThrows` |
| 3 | Sleepy Test | `addSleepy` | Trivial — delete `Thread.sleep` |
| 4 | Conditional Test Logic | `addConditionalLogic` | Low — inline the setup |
| 5 | Mystery Guest | `addLoadsFromFile` | Low — inline the data, delete file I/O |
| 6 | Eager Test | `doEverythingAtOnce` | Medium — split into focused tests |
| 7 | Magic Number | `quantityAfterAdds` | Low — use named variables |
| 8 | Sensitive Equality | `toStringFormat` | Low — assert on semantics |
| 9 | General Fixture | whole class (`rng`) | Trivial — delete the field |
| 10 | Ignored Test | `disabledTest` | Decision — fix or delete |

Items 1–3 prevent **silent false-passes** and should be fixed first. Items 4–5 eliminate **flakiness vectors**. The rest are maintainability improvements.
